WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:18.960
You know what I did for this money?

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.780
What did you do to get this money?

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.120
What did you do to get this money?

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.160
All sorts of horrible shit.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.030
What is that?

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.340
I found it. It was just sitting there.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.460
So what, you were gonna take my cash?

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:51.780
You dropped it in the river.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.360
Behave like a reasonable man.

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:55.920
I want it.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.880
What's wrong with you?

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.940
She's got that look.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.620
Crazy look.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:03.880
We're going to the cops.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.140
No!

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:09.180
You could have anything you want.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.180
Gimme my money!

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.660
I need this, Michael.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.560
Need or want?

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.160
Let me ask you a question.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.800
What usually happens when you finally get something that you wanted forever?

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:33.000
All sorts of horrible shit.

